{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46790","headline":"题画鹭鸶兼简孙郎中 · 齐己","name":"题画鹭鸶兼简孙郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾向沧江看不真，却因图画见精神。\n何妨金粉资高格，不用丹青点此身。\n蒲叶岸长堪映带，荻花丛晚好相亲。\n思量画得胜笼得，野性由来不恋人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}